        {
          "id": 2984980542,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "No, tfs_nt_access_mask_synchronize is also incorrect compared to the content in that commit (strings for both cases are the same, which makes no sense), but I don't know how that one got overwritten in the merge.",
